---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mobile App - VOLI"
  description="Read volleyball news from 10 publishers, listen to 13 volleyball podcasts, follow live scores and stats, and play fantasy volleyball. The Voli app is free on iOS and Android."
  ogUrl="https://playvoli.com/mobileapp"
>
    <main class="card">
        <img src="/images/appicon_sm.webp" alt="VOLI" class="app-icon">
        <h1 class="title">Voli Mobile App</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Our first product — launched January 2026.</p>

        <div class="store-buttons">
            <div class="store-col">
                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/voli-the-volleyball-hub/id6749812982" class="btn-store" target="_blank">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white" width="28" height="28">
                        <path d="M17.05 20.28c-.98.95-2.05.8-3.08.35-1.09-.46-2.09-.48-3.24 0-1.44.62-2.2.44-3.06-.35C2.79 15.25 3.51 7.59 9.05 7.31c1.35.07 2.29.74 3.08.8 1.18-.24 2.31-.93 3.57-.84 1.51.12 2.65.72 3.4 1.8-3.12 1.87-2.38 5.98.48 7.13-.57 1.5-1.31 2.99-2.54 4.09l.01-.01zM12.03 7.25c-.15-2.23 1.66-4.07 3.74-4.25.29 2.58-2.34 4.5-3.74 4.25z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <div class="btn-store-text">
                        <span class="btn-store-label">Download on the</span>
                        <span class="btn-store-name">App Store</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <div class="rating-stars">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="store-downloads">
                <span class="store-downloads-num">2.4k+</span>
                <span class="store-downloads-label">downloads</span>
            </div>
            <div class="store-col">
                <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playvoli.app" class="btn-store" target="_blank">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white" width="28" height="28">
                        <path d="M3.609 1.814L13.792 12 3.61 22.186a.996.996 0 01-.61-.92V2.734a1 1 0 01.609-.92zm10.89 10.893l2.302 2.302-10.937 6.333 8.635-8.635zm3.199-3.198l2.807 1.626a1 1 0 010 1.73l-2.808 1.626L15.206 12l2.492-2.491zM5.864 2.658L16.802 8.99l-2.303 2.303-8.635-8.635z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <div class="btn-store-text">
                        <span class="btn-store-label">Get it on</span>
                        <span class="btn-store-name">Google Play</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <div class="rating-stars">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F0FF1E"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">The Beginning</div>
            <p class="section-text">The Voli mobile app was our first development and the foundation of everything we do. Launched in January 2026, it was built from the ground up by volleyball fans who saw a gap in the sport's digital experience. The app brings together fantasy leagues, real-time stats, live scores, community chat, podcasts, and more — all in one place.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">What's Inside</div>

            <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="App sections">
                <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-fantasy" id="tab-fantasy" data-tab="fantasy">
                    <img src="/images/icons/fantasy_opt.png" alt="" class="tab-icon"><span>Fantasy</span>
                </button>
                <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-stats" id="tab-stats" data-tab="stats">
                    <img src="/images/icons/statistics_opt.png" alt="" class="tab-icon"><span>Stats</span>
                </button>
                <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-games" id="tab-games" data-tab="games">
                    <img src="/images/icons/games_opt.png" alt="" class="tab-icon"><span>Games</span>
                </button>
                <button class="tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-content" id="tab-content" data-tab="content">
                    <img src="/images/icons/content_opt.png" alt="" class="tab-icon"><span>Content</span>
                </button>
                <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-community" id="tab-community" data-tab="community">
                    <img src="/images/icons/community_opt.png" alt="" class="tab-icon"><span>Community</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-fantasy" aria-labelledby="tab-fantasy" data-panel="fantasy" hidden>
                <h2 class="panel-title">Fantasy Volleyball</h2>
                <p class="panel-lede">Contract-based fantasy volleyball leagues for NCAA women's volleyball and Major League Volleyball. Draft players to a salary cap, sign them to multi-round contracts, and score points from real match statistics.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-stats" aria-labelledby="tab-stats" data-panel="stats" hidden>
                <h2 class="panel-title">Volleyball Statistics</h2>
                <p class="panel-lede">In-depth player and team statistics for NCAA and professional volleyball — kills, assists, digs, blocks, aces, hitting percentage and more, sortable by season, conference and round.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-games" aria-labelledby="tab-games" data-panel="games" hidden>
                <h2 class="panel-title">Live Scores &amp; Schedules</h2>
                <p class="panel-lede">Live volleyball scores, full schedules, play-by-play, set-by-set breakdowns and box scores for NCAA women's volleyball and Major League Volleyball.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- CONTENT -->
            <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-content" aria-labelledby="tab-content" data-panel="content">
                <h2 class="panel-title">Volleyball News &amp; Podcasts</h2>
                <p class="panel-lede">
                    Voli is where you read volleyball news and listen to volleyball podcasts in one place.
                    We aggregate coverage from <strong>10 publishers</strong> &mdash; leagues, conferences and
                    independent writers &mdash; and carry <strong>13 volleyball podcasts</strong> with over
                    <strong>900 episodes</strong>, streamable and downloadable inside the app. Free on iOS and Android.
                </p>

                <h3 class="panel-sub">Where our volleyball news comes from</h3>
                <ul class="source-grid">
                    <li><span class="source-name">Major League Volleyball</span><span class="source-meta">provolleyball.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">SEC Sports</span><span class="source-meta">secsports.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">LOVB (League One Volleyball)</span><span class="source-meta">lovb.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">Big Ten Conference</span><span class="source-meta">bigten.org</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">NCAA.com</span><span class="source-meta">ncaa.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">ACC</span><span class="source-meta">theacc.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">Minute Volley</span><span class="source-meta">minutevolley.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">Big 12 Conference</span><span class="source-meta">big12sports.com</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">Elvis Thrill</span><span class="source-meta">Substack</span></li>
                    <li><span class="source-name">Sports Illustrated</span><span class="source-meta">si.com</span></li>
                </ul>
                <p class="panel-note">Coverage spans NCAA women's volleyball, Major League Volleyball, LOVB, team announcements, transfers, rankings and award news. Articles are read in-app with comments, reactions and player and team tagging.</p>

                <h3 class="panel-sub">Volleyball podcasts on Voli</h3>
                <ul class="pod-grid">
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Volley Talk with Sarah Pavan</span><span class="pod-meta">Sarah Pavan &middot; 90 episodes</span><span class="pod-tag">Partner</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">The Major League Minute</span><span class="pod-meta">MLM &middot; 99 episodes</span><span class="pod-tag">Partner</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Court Captains</span><span class="pod-meta">KWND Studios &middot; 67 episodes</span><span class="pod-tag">Partner</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">The USA Volleyball Show</span><span class="pod-meta">USA Volleyball &middot; 152 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Volleyball State</span><span class="pod-meta">Jeff Sheldon &amp; Lincoln Arneal &middot; 151 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Dig City</span><span class="pod-meta">Purdue Volleyball &middot; 125 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">The Side Out Society Podcast</span><span class="pod-meta">Side Out Society &middot; 88 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Serving Pancakes</span><span class="pod-meta">iHeartPodcasts &middot; 60 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Ember's Nest</span><span class="pod-meta">Edward White &middot; 48 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Set 6: The Official MLV Podcast</span><span class="pod-meta">Major League Volleyball &middot; 21 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Six Zone Duo</span><span class="pod-meta">Amie Just &amp; Erin Sorensen &middot; 3 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Volley Takes</span><span class="pod-meta">Abby Benton &middot; 33 episodes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="pod-name">Out of Rotation</span><span class="pod-meta">Dan Meske &middot; 33 episodes</span></li>
                </ul>
                <p class="panel-note">Every episode streams or downloads for offline listening, with playback position synced across devices. Partner podcasts run their own fantasy leagues, AMAs and Take of the Talk sessions inside Voli.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-community" aria-labelledby="tab-community" data-panel="community" hidden>
                <h2 class="panel-title">Volleyball Community</h2>
                <p class="panel-lede">Real-time chat rooms for every match, team and league, plus daily games, polls and a volleyball encyclopedia of records, awards and rankings.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-label">Voli User Testimonials</div>
            <div class="testimonials">
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"This app is everything I've been dreaming of since I've gotten into professional volleyball!"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"It was already so fun to watch volleyball before but now it's a completely new experience watching for your fantasy league. LOVE IT!"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"I've spent years watching my brothers play fantasy football and basketball while wondering 'when can I do this for my sport?' So thank you!!"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"Between the fantasy draft and more games being televised, the usual drought between NCAA seasons has been much less painful. I'm excited to be able to stay engaged with volleyball."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"I really appreciate how interactive this experience has been, especially how it adds a greater fan experience to people who watch, or are trying to learn more about pro volleyball."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"This app is gorgeous. Thanks for putting it out there. And so fun!"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"Y'all are starting something huge that could be a massive growth factor for U.S. volleyball."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"Thank you for your work and for investing in the growth of the sport. Great app and can't wait to continue to support you guys."</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"This app is pretty much as user friendly as it gets. I was trying to find a way to make this happen just so I could participate, so I was so excited when I saw y'all are on it!"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="testimonial">
                    <p>"So impressed with this app and all of your work."</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

<script is:inline>
    // Progressive enhancement: every panel is in the DOM and readable by
    // crawlers whether or not this runs. It only toggles visibility.
    (function () {
        var tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab[data-tab]');
        var panels = document.querySelectorAll('.panel[data-panel]');
        function select(name) {
            tabs.forEach(function (t) {
                var on = t.dataset.tab === name;
                t.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
                t.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');
            });
            panels.forEach(function (p) { p.hidden = p.dataset.panel !== name; });
        }
        tabs.forEach(function (t) {
            t.addEventListener('click', function () { select(t.dataset.tab); });
        });
    })();
</script>

